ParameterCalcViews::calculations - tree rendering (render asTreeDiagram)

calc add
  in x
  in y
  out result
part def Sensor
  attribute a
  attribute b
  attribute gain
  calc sum
    in x
    in ^y
    out ^result
  calc scaled
    in factor
    in ^x
    inout ^count
    out ^doubled
    out ^r

relationships:
  Sensor o-- a
  Sensor o-- b
  Sensor o-- gain
